=== Journey 3: New signup → email verify → first chat ===

Auth flow analysis (Firebase client-side, no backend signup endpoint):
 - SignUpModal.tsx (1104 lines) gates email path: form → 'verifying' → 'success'
 - authService.signUp() calls Firebase createUserWithEmailAndPassword + setDoc(users/{uid}) + sendEmailVerification + signOut
 - User MUST click link in email then sign in again before reaching chat

EXPECTED ROUTE — '/signup' for direct deep-link:
  Per useChat.ts:840 → errorText = "You've reached the guest limit. [Sign up](/signup) for a free account to keep chatting."
  When rendered as Markdown link, clicking opens /signup which is NOT in App.tsx Routes.
  Result: 404 NotFound page instead of opening SignUpModal.

